        dct:description "animated spot field, last frame scored by compute_sim_vs_specimen_cv_similarity — docs/media/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/gif, 4958003 B, 960×720 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 c5d87de63a9f808b7679e75c8748d43f2991764c3694e67932a34bbaaf59ab22 (sha256 c5d87de63a9f808b7679e75c8748d43f2991764c3694e67932a34bbaaf59ab22), spec_fingerprint f5b636dc6a95053a09da7fe5fd86461e841d4ca25eb9122e457e095b842aad73" .
